{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "貞利反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上總歎\n千部論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去竭反，高舉也，音亦傑。三蒼云：舉也，擔也，負也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "普厚反，判也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "貞祐反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔此前意勿恐序也〕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "巨岐反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "身體髮膚，不敢毀傷也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無求生以害仁，有殺身以成仁也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "既明\n且晢，以保其身。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "汝也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "責也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同〔卦〕自得\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "性者，正性也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此上二文，謂繁者請不敘之也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "渠却反。速也，急\n也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "𢍉婢反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云眾賢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音任，一曰如字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "子之反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈呂反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0118001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0118001", "type": "orig", "text": "我字恐衍"}
{"id": null, "n": "0120001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0120001", "type": "orig", "text": "此前等注文未可解恐有脫誤但意推似慮非要用爾"}
{"id": null, "n": "0121001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0121001", "type": "orig", "text": "卦恐者"}
{"id": null, "n": "0122001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0122001", "type": "orig", "text": "想疑總"}
{"id": null, "n": "0122002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0122002", "type": "orig", "text": "自明下恐有脫字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0123001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0123001", "type": "orig", "text": "屬恐勵"}
{"id": null, "n": "0123002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0123002", "type": "orig", "text": "吳猛未言之前者未詳依晉書張華傳但言初吳之未滅余所閱豫章古今記不載此事更檢"}
{"id": null, "n": "0118c0601", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0118c0601", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0119a1201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0119a1201", "type": "add", "text": "刺【CB】，剌【卍續】"}
